{ Endoscopy port supplement: L_packet.at additions that live on origin/endoscopy_side
  but were never merged to master. These are additive overloads (master's L_packet.at
  has only L_packets([Param])). Deps all present in master:
    all_parameters_gamma  -> K_highest_weights.at (via strong_real_forms.at)
    strong_real_forms / pure_strong_real_forms -> strong_real_forms.at
  Source: git show origin/endoscopy_side:atlas-scripts/L_packet.at (lines ~82-89). }

<L_packet.at
<strong_real_forms.at

set L_packets(RealForm G,ratvec gamma)=[[Param]]:
L_packets(all_parameters_gamma(G,gamma))

set L_packets(InnerClass ic,ratvec gamma)=[[Param]]:
##for G in strong_real_forms(ic) do L_packets(G,gamma)  od

set pure_L_packets(InnerClass ic,ratvec gamma)=[[Param]]:
##for G in pure_strong_real_forms(ic) do L_packets(G,gamma)  od
